# Ideas


TODO: thinking shouildnt stop while tool calls are running, just like humans you can run a tool and still think and if its taking too long stop it and look etc. forcing single threading doesnt ammount to real intelligence

- Computer interaction: screenshots, mouse, and keyboard.
- Runtime commands: `/summarize`, `/model`, `/reasoning`, and `/tree`.
- An agent scratchpad with optional user-visible progress.
- Self-inspection and customization.
- Subagents and awareness of other running agents.
- Append-only session event log for explicit durability and crash recovery.
